# Bookdown gitbook dependency cache — regenerated on every render_book() call.
# Left uncontrolled, output_dir: "." combined with in-place rendering causes this
# directory to occasionally copy itself into itself across repeated renders,
# ballooning to hundreds of MB. Never commit it.
Livro/_bookdown_files/

# Kept on disk for whoever edits the course locally, never published: this file
# documents Claude Code's own working conventions, and the professor does not
# want any trace of AI-assistant tooling reachable on the published site.
CLAUDE.md

